# Compiled-in defaults for NucleoH743-SimVIO (bench B4). This board stores no parameters, so
# settings that only take effect after a reboot must live here.
# simulated GPS; it needs a GPS-protocol port to exist (SERIAL1 = USART3 placeholder)
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 5
GPS_TYPE 100
# KV260 link on UART7: MAVLink2 at 921600
SERIAL3_PROTOCOL 2
SERIAL3_BAUD 921
# visual odometry backend: MAVLink
VISO_TYPE 1
# EKF3 source set 2 = external nav (vision position, velocity and yaw; baro height). EKF3 creates
# its external-nav buffers at boot only if some source set uses external nav, so switching set 1
# to external nav at runtime without this fuses nothing (docs/errors.md E23). Set 1 stays GPS;
# switch sets with MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET or by setting EK3_SRC1_* at runtime.
EK3_SRC2_POSXY 6
EK3_SRC2_VELXY 6
EK3_SRC2_POSZ 1
EK3_SRC2_YAW 6
